<title>JAPAN: TEPCO launches 6.5% 4 bln French franc straights.</title>
<headline>TEPCO launches 6.5% 4 bln French franc straights.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tokyo Electric Power Co Inc (TEPCO) said it launched on Tuesday four billion French francs worth of 6.5 percent 10-year straight bonds due September 27, 2006.</p>
<p>The bond is priced at 99.403.</p>
</text>
